  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**__BODMAS RULE:__**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Option (1): × and ÷**\n\nGiven equation: 72 **÷** 36 + 12 **×** 13 - 48 = 63\n\nInterchanged equation is : 72 × 36 + __**12 **____**÷**____** 13**__ - 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ ** __**72 × 36**__+ 0.92 - 48 = 63\n\n**⇒** __**2592 + 0.92**__ - 48 = 63\n\n⇒** __2592.92 __- 48 ** = 63\n\n**⇒** 2544.92 ≠ 63\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (2): + and -**\n\nGiven equation: 72 ÷ 36 **+** 12 × 13** ****-** 48 = 63\n\nInterchanged equation is: __**72 ÷ 36**__ **- **12 × 13 **+** 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ **2 - __**12 × 13**__ + 48 = 63 \n\n**⇒** **2** - 156 **+ 48** = 63\n\n⇒ __**2 + 48**__ - 156 = 63 \n\n**⇒ 50 - 156 = 63**\n\n⇒ **-106 ≠ 63**\n\n**⇒ ****LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (3): + and ÷**\n\nGiven equation: 72 **÷** 36 **+**** **12 × 13 - 48 = 63\n\nInterchanged equation is: 72 **+__ 36 ÷ 12__** × 13 - 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ **72 + __**3 **____**× 13**__ - 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ __72 + 39__** - 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ __111 - 48__** = 63\n\n**⇒ 63 = 63**\n\n**⇒ ****LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option (4): × and -**\n\nGiven equation: 72 ÷ 36 + 12 **×** 13 **-** 48 = 63\n\nInterchanged equation is: __**72 ÷ 36**__ + 12 **-** 13 **×** 48 = 63\n\n**⇒ **2 + 12 - __**13 ×**____** 48**__ = 63\n\n**⇒ __2 + 12__** - 624 = 63\n\n**⇒ 14 - 624 = 63**\n\n**⇒ - 610**** ≠ 63**\n\n**⇒ ****LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+ and ÷\"**.",
